    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Goldenglow, Rhodes Island Logistics Operator. Primary place of work is the Rhodes Island hair salon; under typical circumstances, is not dispatched in Field Operator capacity.\nUses a specially designed staff, conducting attacks on the enemy via control of 'Driftbeacon' Arts Units."
